{
  "id": "E376",
  "title": "Looking Like a Panda",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2019-11-16",
  "synopsis": "What do Chinese people mean when they say you look like a panda?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50376/aff07af3abcdbdc21f50a112e20c133e53e4794c.mp3?1573478552",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "像熊猫一样\n\n小乐：你昨晚没睡好吗？\n保罗：昨天我的好朋友过生日，我去参加他的生日派对了。\n小乐：难怪你的眼睛跟熊猫一样。\n保罗：是呀，我们玩了一个通宵。今天真的觉得非常累。\n小乐：通宵真的对身体很不好。你以后别通宵了。",
    "traditional": "像熊貓一樣\n\n小樂：你昨晚沒睡好嗎？\n保羅：昨天我的好朋友過生日，我去參加他的生日派對了。\n小樂：難怪你的眼睛跟熊貓一樣。\n保羅：是呀，我們玩了一個通宵。今天真的覺得非常累。\n小樂：通宵真的對身體很不好。你以後別通宵了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Looking Like a Panda"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：你昨晚没睡好吗？",
      "traditional": "小樂：你昨晚沒睡好嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ zuó wǎn méi shuì hǎo ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Didn’t you get enough sleep last night?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：昨天我的好朋友过生日，我去参加他的生日派对了。",
      "traditional": "保羅：昨天我的好朋友過生日，我去參加他的生日派對了。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó zuó tiān wǒ de hǎo péng you guò shēng rì wǒ qù cān jiā tā de shēng rì pài duì le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: A good friend of mine had his birthday yesterday. I went to his birthday party."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐：难怪你的眼睛跟熊猫一样。",
      "traditional": "小樂：難怪你的眼睛跟熊貓一樣。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nán guài nǐ de yǎn jing gēn xióng māo yí yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: No wonder your eyes look like a panda’s."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "保罗：是呀，我们玩了一个通宵。今天真的觉得非常累。",
      "traditional": "保羅：是呀，我們玩了一個通宵。今天真的覺得非常累。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó shì ya wǒ men wán le yí ge tōng xiāo jīn tiān zhēn de jué de fēi cháng lèi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Yes, we were partying all night. I feel really tired today."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小乐：通宵真的对身体很不好。你以后别通宵了。",
      "traditional": "小樂：通宵真的對身體很不好。你以後別通宵了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè tōng xiāo zhēn de duì shēn tǐ hěn bù hǎo nǐ yǐ hòu bié tōng xiāo le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Staying up all night is really bad for your health. Don’t stay up all night anymore in the future."
    }
  ],
